{
  "title": "Aurora · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "MySQL·PostgreSQL 호환 관리형 관계형 DB다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Aurora</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#cluster-volume\">Cluster Volume</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#writer-and-aurora-replicas\">Writer and Aurora Replicas</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#cluster-reader-and-custom-endpoints\">Cluster, Reader and Custom Endpoints</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#aurora-auto-scaling\">Aurora Auto Scaling</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#aurora-serverless-v2\">Aurora Serverless v2</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#aurora-global-database\">Aurora Global Database</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#failover-and-promotion-tiers\">Failover and Promotion Tiers</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#backups-pitr-and-cloning\">Backups, PITR and Cloning</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#aurora-standard-and-i-o-optimized\">Aurora Standard and I/O-Optimized</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#backtrack-and-engine-features\">Backtrack and Engine Features</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>데이터베이스</span><span>04 / 62</span></div><h1>Aurora</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 10 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Amazon Aurora는 MySQL·PostgreSQL 호환의 관리형 관계형 Database다. Compute Instance와 여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 분산된 Cluster Storage를 분리해 내구성·가용성·읽기 확장을 제공한다.</p><p>Storage 복제, Reader 수 확장, Instance Compute 확장과 Global 복제는 각각 다른 기능이다. “<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">Auto Scaling</a>”이라는 이름만 보고 Writer CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span>와 Reader 수가 함께 자동 증가한다고 판단하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Reader 수와 Compute 크기\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Reader 수와 Compute 크기</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Replica count</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Read demand</strong><small>읽기 부하 증가</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#aurora-auto-scaling\">Aurora Auto Scaling</a></strong><small>Reader 수 조정</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Reader Endpoint</strong><small>새 Connection 분산</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Compute capacity</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Variable workload</strong><small>CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span>·Memory 수요 변화</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#aurora-serverless-v2\">Aurora Serverless v2</a></strong><small>지원 Instance의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#aurora-serverless-v2\">ACU</a> 조정</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Cluster Storage</strong><small>Compute와 별도 관리</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Storage 복제, Reader 수, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#aurora-serverless-v2\">ACU</a>와 Global Database는 서로 다른 확장 축이다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"cluster-volume\"><h2>Cluster Volume<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#cluster-volume\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Cluster Storage는 세 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 여러 Copy를 유지하는 분산 구조다. Writer와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#aurora-replicas\">Aurora Replicas</a>가 같은 논리 Storage를 사용한다. Storage 내구성이 있어도 실행할 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Compute와 Connection 장애 대응은 필요하다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"writer-and-aurora-replicas\"><h2>Writer and Aurora Replicas<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#writer-and-aurora-replicas\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>일반 Cluster에는 쓰기를 담당하는 Writer와 읽기용 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#aurora-replicas\">Aurora Replicas</a>가 있다. Reader는 읽기 부하 분산과 Failover Candidate 역할을 한다. Replica 수 증가는 Writer의 모든 쓰기 처리량을 자동 확장하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"cluster-reader-and-custom-endpoints\"><h2>Cluster, Reader and Custom Endpoints<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#cluster-reader-and-custom-endpoints\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Cluster Endpoint는 현재 Writer를, Reader Endpoint는 Reader Connection을 대상으로 한다. Custom Endpoint는 특정 Instance 집합으로 Workload를 분리한다. Connection을 장기간 유지하면 새 Reader가 생겨도 기존 연결이 자동 재분배되는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"aurora-auto-scaling\"><h2>Aurora Auto Scaling<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#aurora-auto-scaling\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>지표·정책에 따라 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#aurora-replicas\">Aurora Replica</a> 수를 조정한다. Provisioned Writer의 Instance Class를 바꾸는 기능과 다르다. 최소·최대 Replica 수와 Scale-in 때 Connection 영향을 고려한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"aurora-serverless-v2\"><h2>Aurora Serverless v2<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#aurora-serverless-v2\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#reference-3\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 3\">[3]</a></h2><p>지원 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Instance의 Compute를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#aurora-serverless-v2\">ACU</a> 단위로 자동 조정한다. 최소·최대 Capacity와 Version별 Auto-pause·0 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#aurora-serverless-v2\">ACU</a> 지원을 확인한다. Provisioned Reader 수 확장과 Compute Capacity 확장은 별개의 축이다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"aurora-global-database\"><h2>Aurora Global Database<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#aurora-global-database\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>에 Storage 기반 복제를 제공해 지역 읽기와 DR을 지원한다. Secondary <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>의 Replica Lag과 Planned Switchover·Unplanned Failover의 데이터 손실 조건을 구분한다. 기본 모델에서 모든 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>이 독립 Writer가 되는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"failover-and-promotion-tiers\"><h2>Failover and Promotion Tiers<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#failover-and-promotion-tiers\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Writer 장애 시 지원 Reader를 승격하며 Promotion Tier로 우선순위를 조정한다. 앱은 새 Writer 연결과 Retry를 처리해야 한다. Reader를 두지 않은 구성은 Compute 복구 경로와 시간이 달라질 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"backups-pitr-and-cloning\"><h2>Backups, PITR <span class=\"full-name\">(Point-in-Time Recovery)</span> and Cloning<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#backups-pitr-and-cloning\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>지속 Backup과 Snapshot에서 새 Cluster를 Restore할 수 있다. Clone은 지원 조건에서 Copy-on-write로 개발·테스트 환경을 빠르게 만든다. Clone 생성은 장기 보존 Backup 정책을 대신하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"aurora-standard-and-i-o-optimized\"><h2>Aurora Standard and I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span>-Optimized<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#aurora-standard-and-i-o-optimized\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Storage·I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span> 과금 모델의 선택지다. I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span>-Optimized는 I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span> 집약 Workload에서 비용 구조를 단순화할 수 있다. 이름만 보고 모든 Workload에서 더 저렴하다고 판단하지 말고 Instance·Storage·I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span> 사용량을 비교한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"backtrack-and-engine-features\"><h2>Backtrack and Engine Features<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#backtrack-and-engine-features\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>지원 Aurora MySQL 구성의 Backtrack은 이전 시점으로 Database를 되돌리는 기능이다. Snapshot Restore·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#backups-pitr-and-cloning\">PITR</a>과 동작·제약이 다르다. MySQL 전용 기능을 Aurora PostgreSQL에도 동일하게 적용하지 않는다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>조회량이 시간대별로 변하면 Reader 수를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#aurora-auto-scaling\">Aurora Auto Scaling</a>으로 조정한다. Writer·Reader의 Compute 자체가 크게 변하면 Serverless v2의 Capacity 모델을 비교한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>스토리지 내구성, 읽기 확장, 컴퓨팅 용량 확장은 서로 다른 기능이다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonRDS/latest/AuroraUserGuide/CHAP_AuroraOverview.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AmazonRDS/latest/AuroraUserGuide/CHAP_AuroraOverview.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonRDS/latest/AuroraUserGuide/Aurora.Integrating.AutoScaling.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AmazonRDS/latest/AuroraUserGuide/Aurora.Integrating.AutoScaling.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-3\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonRDS/latest/AuroraUserGuide/aurora-serverless-v2.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AmazonRDS/latest/AuroraUserGuide/aurora-serverless-v2.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q057/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q057\" data-question=\"Q057\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q057</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q057/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An Aurora application must separate read queries from its writer and distribute them across replicas. Which endpoint should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q057\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the writer endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q057\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A NAT gateway Elastic IP</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q057\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The reader endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q057\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS volume ID</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/\">Aurora</a>의 reader endpoint는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">읽기 복제본</a>으로 연결을 분산한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/\">Aurora</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q054\" data-question=\"Q054\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q054</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q054/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Can the standby instance of a standard RDS Multi-AZ DB instance deployment serve read queries?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes. Every standby is readable</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">No. The standby in this deployment type is for failover</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if Route 53 is used</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if the network ACL is opened</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스의 standby는 읽기 요청을 처리하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 클러스터와 구분한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q055\" data-question=\"Q055\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q055</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q055/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An RDS database has increasing read traffic, and the application can tolerate some replication lag. Which option most directly scales reads?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An additional security group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a Multi-AZ DB instance standby</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a>가 읽기 요청을 나눈다. 보통 비동기 복제 지연을 고려한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q087\" data-question=\"Q087\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,4\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q087</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q087/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to improve both availability and read throughput for an existing RDS DB instance. Which TWO options address these goals?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q087\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A Multi-AZ DB instance deployment</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q087\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">NAT Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q087\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A single Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q087\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q087\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">A read replica</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, E</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스는 장애 조치, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a>는 읽기 확장에 맞춘다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q056\" data-question=\"Q056\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q056</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q056/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An RDS DB instance needs automatic failover, but read scaling is not required. Which deployment should be selected?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q056\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q056\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Versioning</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q056\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">DynamoDB DAX</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q056\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A Multi-AZ DB instance deployment</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스 standby는 고가용성을 위한 선택이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">이전 용어 <b>API Gateway</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">다음 용어 <b>AWS Backup</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
